  "releaseNotes": "FFmpeg 9.0.1 - \"Lei\"\n\t\t\tVersion numbering scheme changed: FFMpegMajor.Major.Minor.Patch\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t--- 9.9.0.1 ---\n\t\t\tBugFix: - Fixed a bug concerning the incorrect size of CLong/CULong on Windows or 32bit and netstandard. \n\t\t\tSee AutoGen (v9.0.1.1) release notes for more details.",
